       "en": "Do not torment young bachelors, dear,"
      },
      {
       "cyr": "да носат тешки камења.",
       "lat": "da nosat teški kamenja.",
       "en": "to carry heavy stones."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "lines": [
      {
